{title: Yaar Ko Maine Mujhe Yaar Ne}
{artist: Kunal Ganjawala Sheesha}
{key: F}

{c: Verse 1}
[F]yaar ko [A#]maine, mujhe [D#]yaar ne,        [F]sone na diya
[F]yaar ko [A#]maine, mujhe [D#]yaar ne,        [F]sone na diya
[F]pyar hi pyar kiya,        [F]pyar hi pyar kiya
[A#]pyar ne [D#]sone na diyaa [F]aa,        [F]yaar ko [A#]maine, mujhe [D#]yaar ne
[F]sone na diya,        [F]uski chudi [D#]yo ki khanak
[D#]uski wo bindi [A#]ya ki [F]chamak,        uski chudi [A#]yo ki khanak
uski wo [D#]bindiya ki chamakk [F]kk,        [F]haaye kaj [A#]re ki gazab [D#]dhaar ne
[F]sone na diya,        [F]pyar hi pyar kiya
[F]pyar hi pyar kiya,        [A#]pyar ne [D#]sone na diyaa [F]aa
[F]uski ang [D#]dayi ne,        [D#]kya kya na kaya [A#]mat [F]dhayi
[F]uski ang [A#]dayi ne,        [A#]kya kya na kaya [D#]mat dhayii [F]ii
[F]dhadkano [A#]ki badhi raf [D#]tar ne,        [F]sone na diya
[F]pyar hi pyar kiya,        [F]pyar hi pyar kiya
[A#]pyar ne [D#]sone na diyaa [F]aa
